My mother says, "Maya, it is night now."
I say, "Yes, it is morning here, but it is night there."
My father says, "Good night, Maya."
I say, "Good night, Papa."
"Good night, Mom."
My sister Sofia waves her hand.
She says, "Bye, Maya!"
My brother Diego also smiles.
I say, "Bye, Sofia!"
"Bye, Diego!"
Lola barks one more time.
My mother says, "We love you very much."
I say, "I love you very much too."
Everyone waves their hands and says bye.
I close my laptop.
The video call ends.
The laptop screen turns off.
Suddenly there is absolute quiet in my room.
I am alone at my desk.
It is a quiet Sunday.
